<title>TURKEY: Turk Tupras buys 50,000 T gas oil from Glencore.</title>
<headline>Turk Tupras buys 50,000 T gas oil from Glencore.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state oil refinery, Tupras, said on Monday it imported a total of 50,000 tonnes of gas oil from Glencore through a tender.</p>
<p>It said in a statement 25,000 tonnes of the purchase would be made on May 18-20 at a premium of $8.29 per tonne and the remaining 25,000 tonnes on May 26-30 at $8.39 per tonne.</p>
<p>Deliveries will be made to Izmit port. All prices are based off fob Mediterranean Italy quotations.</p>
<p>Tupras held the tender on May 1.</p>
<p>--Ercan Ersoy, Ankara newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
</text>
